Cell["\<\
Shell 1 is the zero-distance onsite shell; shell 2 is the shortest \
nonzero-distance neighbour shell.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"b73f3900-94a9-4611-8030-01595369c08d"],

Cell["\<\
The output identifies the starting site, the translated ending site, and the \
displacement of each directed bond.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"c995c247-ef0e-400d-ab6a-d5c1d2be5d14"],

Cell["\<\
The shell must have been prepared by init. showbonds does not search farther \
and does not evaluate symham.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"22dc2134-7de4-4a66-92a8-887438507ec9"]
}, Closed]],

